{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">無綫劇集《非份之罪》於16日播出新單元《危險遊戲》。一向予人健康正氣印象的吳偉豪，在劇中首度挑戰飾演自大、<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">自私且個性尖酸刻薄的角色，演出令人驚喜，成功展現出角色「入型入格」的陰險本色。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">單元講述網台「每週一渣」的導演危家仁（吳偉豪飾），在三個月前的一次直播中，因吸入罐裝氣體而斃命，警方隨即展開調查。劇中的危家仁為了流量與打賞，完全毫無道德底線。他不僅逼迫網紅藍芯凌（胡敏芝飾）穿上尺度極大的比堅尼，更在對方嘗試保護自己時態度極其惡劣，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">幸好最終網台總監徐忠泰阻撓才擱置計劃</span>。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1ea0294a-2bf8-4dc4-b8c0-58b04e5933dc.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20260qma82dwD11784257202.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1ea0294a-2bf8-4dc4-b8c0-58b04e5933dc.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">此外，他還暗中錄音並扭曲下屬駿傑（張翼東飾）的原意，致使其短片惡評如潮，隨後更將責任全部推卸給對方，做事陰險狡詐。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">當駿傑得悉後大罵家仁 ，家仁則狂踩對方：「如果我忌才就唔會執你兩件垃圾返嚟，教你哋拍片剪片同埋度橋啦」、「你兩個覺得自己有料，我咪放手畀你哋擔大旗，結果好明顯，負評多到數唔晒，證明咗你兩隻嘢幾無能」句句都Mean到爆！</span><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">而在面對上司徐總與復健會代表時，家仁瞬間「變臉」，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">將所有責任推到駿傑身上，更趁機展現自己能幹、有承責的一面將雙面人的奸詐演繹得淋漓盡致。</span><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">對於這次的突破性演出，吳偉豪在接受 <a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"http://tvb.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">tvb.com</a> 訪問時坦言，這是他演藝生涯中最令人「乞人憎」的角色：「<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">Amy姐（監製）話想帶出個意思係即使外表正氣吸引，但內裏幾衰幾難頂，都會有人支持崇拜佢。</span>」他透露，劇中許多刻薄的對白均參考了電影與電視劇的演出，有時更會即興加入貼合生活感、更為強烈的對白。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d92d7f94-167b-4cbb-8a9a-88f4019e91af.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026XDxF3hapd71784257206.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d92d7f94-167b-4cbb-8a9a-88f4019e91af.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">他指不覺自己搞笑也不喜歡整蠱人，惟喜歡看整蠱片 ，「劇中我好多講嘢難聽嘅說話都係參考一啲電影同電視劇嘅演出。」 談到今次角色又串又Mean，與過往大不同，「我最初真係唔好慣個角色咁串，但我都跟住劇本所帶出嘅意思要嘅感覺去呈現，有時我都唔會跟劇本，去到嗰刻需要咩效果，我就再諗啲平時生活會講嘅嘢再爆啲。」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\"> </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">吳偉豪續說：「我成日覺得最乞人憎同奸嘅人唔係表面會畀你睇到 ，佢哋表面對你好好，但暗地裏可能利用你，而我希望做到呢個效果。」</span><br/></p><h4 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">劇集播出後，不少網民對吳偉豪的表現感到驚喜，紛紛稱讚他演得超乎預期，留言大讚：「估唔到Ricco演得咁好」、「第一次見Ricco做呢類角色，好正」、「完全擺脫了朱凌凌的影子」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-18T11:18:36.832379+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":932,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}